          Tailored SEO Roadmaps for Every Online Retail Vertical
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-[13.5px] sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-justify hyphens-auto [text-align-last:left]">
          Different consumer product categories require distinct search mechanics and visual merchandising strategies. Here is how we optimize each e-commerce vertical in Lucknow.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Columns x 2 Rows Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-7">
        {propertySegments.map((ind) => (
          <div class={`elevated-card rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-7 border-t-4 ${ind.accentBorder} flex flex-col justify-between sm:hover:-translate-y-1`}>
