    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-7 sm:gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center">
        <!-- Left 7 Columns: Conclusion Paragraphs (Justified) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 min-w-0">
          <div class="badge-dark mb-3.5 sm:mb-4">Elevate Your Online Retail Brand</div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[1.45rem] sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-snug sm:leading-tight mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            Scale Profitable Direct-to-Consumer GMV Across Lucknow & India
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-5 text-slate-300 text-[13.5px] sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-justify hyphens-auto [text-align-last:left]">
            <p>
              Online consumer brands relying only on paid ads face thin margins and unpredictable costs. Lasting success comes from an organic search presence that brings ready-to-buy shoppers directly to your store, earning steady sales through top Google rankings and AI recommendations.
            </p>
            <p>
              NK Digital Tech helps you outrank big marketplaces, cut paid ad costs, and build direct customer loyalty. Partner with our team to scale your online brand profitably.
